Version 3: Lwn Level 1.5,DATA USAGE: Due to the research and development phase characterizing AERONET-Ocean Color, use of these data requires offering co-authorship to the Principal Investigator (PI). The public domain data you have downloaded are contributed by the International AERONET Federation. Each site has a Principal Investigator(s) (PI) responsible for deployment; maintenance; and data collection. The PI has priority use of the data collected at the site. The PI is entitled to be informed of any other use of that site data.
The following data are cloud cleared and quality controls have been applied but these data may not have final calibration applied.  These data may change.
Contact: PI=Dimitry_Van_der_Zande; PI Email=dvanderzande@naturalsciences.be
